"hero-copy\"><div class=\"idx reveal\"><span>00 — FLAGSHIP / MMXXVI</span></div><span class=\"eyebrow reveal\">The Art Of Movement</span><h1 class=\"kin\" aria-label=\"Drive Beyond  Ordinary\"><span class=\"kin-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Drive Beyond  Ordinary</span></span></h1><div class=\"reveal\"><div><div class=\"ck-content\"><p>The future is not arriving. It is already waiting for you — engineered in silence, sculpted for the road ahead.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hero-cta reveal\"><a target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary magnetic\" href=\"/models\">Explore The Range</a><a target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/brand\">The Brand</a></div></div><div class=\"hero-media\"><div class=\"frame tilt zoomable parallax reveal-frame\" data-speed=\"0.08\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"VELARO in motion\"><img alt=\"VELARO in motion\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://xmc-sitecoresaa110c-hahnsoloff1c-cm386d.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Velaro/velaro-hero.jpg?h=1143&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2048&amp;ttc=63923863542&amp;tt=327DA8816EF5D1A2EB9B650D98414FD1\"/></div><div class=\"hero-caption\"><span class=\"tick live\"></span>VELARO GT · Study 01</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head reveal\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">The Range</span><h2>Six expressions of motion</h2></div><p class=\"lead\">From the everyday extraordinary to the track-bred extreme — each VELARO is a distinct argument for the same idea.</p></div><div class=\"marquee\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"marquee__track\"><span class=\"marquee__item\">VELARO One<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item muted\">VELARO S<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item\">VELARO GT<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item muted\">VELARO RS<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item\">VELARO X<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item muted\">VELARO Aero<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item\">VELARO One<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item muted\">VELARO S<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item\">VELARO GT<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item muted\">VELARO RS<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item\">VELARO X<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span><span class=\"marquee__item muted\">VELARO Aero<!-- --> <span class=\"dot\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"index-rows\"><a class=\"irow reveal\" href=\"/models/velaro-one\"><div class=\"numeral\" data-count=\"1\" data-pad=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div><div class=\"name\">VELARO One<small>The essential VELARO. Where the story begins.</small></div><div class=\"thumb frame zoomable\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"VELARO One\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://xmc-sitecoresaa110c-hahnsoloff1c-cm386d.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Velaro/velaro-one.jpg?h=1143&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2048&amp;ttc=63923863542&amp;tt=D6ECD1BC3A5A9BC268AA1A9CB5E8A6D1&amp;hash=315609C027886860464DF283D0FB0AD9\"/></div><div class=\"go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div></a><a class=\"irow reveal\" href=\"/models/velaro-s\"><div class=\"numeral\" data-count=\"2\" data-pad=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div><div class=\"name\">VELARO S<small>Sharpened instincts. Everyday brilliance, quickened.</small></div><div class=\"thumb frame zoomable\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"VELARO S\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://xmc-sitecoresaa110c-hahnsoloff1c-cm386d.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Velaro/velaro-s.jpg?h=1143&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2048&amp;ttc=63923863542&amp;tt=EB5717F106A4ECFFC27948E56F174430&amp;hash=B65BCE4714EBDE4FF067D909AB6D4188\"/></div><div class=\"go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div></a><a class=\"irow reveal\" href=\"/models/velaro-gt\"><div class=\"numeral\" data-count=\"3\" data-pad=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div><div class=\"name\">VELARO GT<small>Grand touring, reimagined. Distance made desirable.</small></div><div class=\"thumb frame zoomable\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"VELARO GT\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://xmc-sitecoresaa110c-hahnsoloff1c-cm386d.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Velaro/velaro-gt.jpg?h=1143&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2048&amp;ttc=63923863542&amp;tt=19D28FC4726ED2E8A6D76292F428962B&amp;hash=A8AC1B5DFAC237B75B560D88C55AA8FE\"/></div><div class=\"go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div></a><a class=\"irow reveal\" href=\"/models/velaro-rs\"><div class=\"numeral\" data-count=\"4\" data-pad=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</div><div class=\"name\">VELARO RS<small>Track-bred precision for the open road.</small></div><div class=\"thumb frame zoomable\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"VELARO RS\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://xmc-sitecoresaa110c-hahnsoloff1c-cm386d.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Velaro/velaro-rs.jpg?h=1143&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2048&amp;ttc=63923863542&amp;tt=70EA54A179B44D02E5E89590AE785621&amp;hash=5D1119490F5DDC1B1CF204DD84ADE088\"/></div><div class=\"go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div></a><a class=\"irow reveal\" href=\"/models/velaro-x\"><div class=\"numeral\" data-count=\"5\" data-pad=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</div><div class=\"name\">VELARO X<small>The frontier model. Where VELARO goes next.</small></div><div class=\"thumb frame zoomable\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"VELARO X\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://xmc-sitecoresaa110c-hahnsoloff1c-cm386d.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Velaro/velaro-x.jpg?h=1143&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2048&amp;ttc=63923863542&amp;tt=D51615F9853140EF2712501A07232352&amp;hash=4C05DB19D7F116F0E1E1763405D8DD8D\"/></div><div class=\"go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div></a><a class=\"irow reveal\" href=\"/models/velaro-aero\"><div class=\"numeral\" data-count=\"6\" data-pad=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">06</div><div class=\"name\">VELARO Aero<small>Shaped by air, driven by silence. The halo of the line.</small></div><div class=\"thumb frame zoomable\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"VELARO Aero\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://xmc-sitecoresaa110c-hahnsoloff1c-cm386d.sitecorecloud.io/-/media/Velaro/Aero/velaro-aero-poster.jpg?h=1143&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2048&amp;ttc=63923863542&amp;tt=7E04784E77C89954E06F4F8FAAF6B827&amp;hash=9C635DBE805600BBD2E6FC75DE1C8A88\"/></div><div class=\"go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</div></a></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid12 values\"><div class=\"vhead reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Design Doctrine</span><h2>Five convictions, one direction</h2><div><p>Every VELARO begins with a belief: that movement should mean something. Design first, emotion through motion, and forward momentum in everything we make.</p></div></div><div class=\"vgrid reveal\"><div class=\"vcell\"><div class=\"n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div><h3>Design First</h3><div><p>Form is never decoration. Every line earns its place — sculpted to move air, and to move you.</p></div></div><div class=\"vcell\"><div class=\"n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div><h3>Emotion Through Motion</h3><div><p>A car should be felt before it is understood. We engineer the feeling first.</p></div></div><div class=\"vcell\"><div class=\"n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div><h3>Intelligent Innovation</h3><div><p>Technology that disappears into the experience. Quiet, precise, always in service of the drive.</p></div></div><div class=\"vcell\"><div class=\"n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</div><h3>Quiet Confidence</h3><div><p>Presence without noise. The most powerful statement is the one that needs no announcement.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"vfs reveal vfs--teaser\" id=\"finish-selector\" data-finishes=\"4\"><div class=\"vfs__inner\"><p class=\"vfs__eyebrow\">Configure</p><h2 class=\"vfs__headline\">Yours begins with a c